<title>GERMANY: BfG says expects better H2 earnings.</title>
<headline>BfG says expects better H2 earnings.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>German commercial bank BfG Bank AG said on Tuesday that it expected a clear improvement in earnings in the second half of the year which would translate into satisfactory earnings for the full year.</p>
<p>The bank, which reported a lower operating profit after risk provisions in the first half of 1996, however said that in light of expectations for satisfactory earnings for the full year, the group may consider paying a higher dividend.</p>
</text>
